  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Saudi Arabia Human Rights Commission on Business and Human Rights (BHR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A series of seminars on Business and Human Rights BHR will be organised starting with the development of the Roadmap and Strategy and working towards engagement with private sector, initially inviting Dutch and Saudi large and medium-size businesses as well as primary stakeholders, in coordination with SHRC, the Dutch Embassy in Riyadh, the UNRCO in Saudi Arabia, and relevant UN Agencies. These seminars will create a space for open discussions and will follow on the methodology of a fact-based dialogue process, which will culminate in the creation of a joint working group or a steering committee in order to follow up on some specific recommendations or prioritised issues emanated as an outcome of these seminars.</narrative>
  </description>
